{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_bbshfmwnx3ldircjrqxjwh236n5jlkie4szx33mmdoe5kvi5tfda","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The FoodWagon landing page is built in **03 · Workspace**. I took screenshots of every section and fixed the problems I saw. The brief says this is a single page with nothing to link, so I didn't add any prototype connections. Everything was done with the account zuohaosheng@tetras.ai.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/nNa8Gsj0yGpnGfKLYRu7xU/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `11:2`\n\n**Screen**\n- **01_Home** (`16:138`), 1920 × 9113, light mode. From top to bottom: Header, Hero, Discounts, How does it work, Popular items, Featured Restaurants, Search by Food, Features, Deals, App promo, Call to action, Footer.\n\n**Components** (in the frame \"Components · FoodWagon\", `13:2`, placed to the right of the page)\n- **Basic parts:**\n  - Button (`13:91`): 4 styles (Primary, Secondary, Soft, Ghost), each with Default, Hover and Disabled, and a settable label and icon.\n  - Carousel Arrow (`13:113`): previous and next, each with Default, Hover and Disabled.\n  - Hero Tab (`13:135`): Current, Default and Hover.\n  - Field / Icon (`13:160`): Default, Focused and Filled, built on the Text Field from 02 · Components.\n  - Discount and Fast badges; Status Pill (`13:179`) for \"Open Now\" and \"Opens tomorrow\"; a logo mark showing restaurant initials (`13:180`).\n- **Page sections and cards:**\n  - Header (`14:47`), Discount Card (`14:81`), Step Card (`14:92`), Feature Item (`14:99`).\n  - Popular Item Card (`14:133`, Default and Hover), which uses the Button from 02 · Components for \"Order Now\".\n  - Food Category Tile (`14:145`, Default and Hover), Restaurant Card (`15:70`).\n  - Deal Banner (`15:125`, photo on the left or right), App Promo (`15:129`), CTA Banner (`15:137`).\n  - Footer Link (`15:155`, Default and Hover) and Footer (`15:156`). The footer's \"Subscribe\" also uses the Button from 02 · Components.\n\n**What's on the page**\n- All copy and data follow the fixed data in the brief: 4 discounts, 4 steps, 5 popular items, 8 restaurants with initials, ratings and open status, 6 food categories, 3 deals, 24 cities, the footer link groups and the copyright line.\n- Photos, logo, app mockup, store badges, social logos and icons are all copies of the 04 · Media assets, not redrawn. I recoloured the icons to match the page.\n- Every word is in Source Sans Pro, using the two brand colours #F17228 and #FFB30E. The other colours, sizes, spacing and corner rounding are my own choices, applied consistently.\n- **States shown on the page:** Delivery is the selected tab and Pickup isn't. Foodworld and Pizzahub show \"Opens tomorrow\"; the other six show \"Open Now\". In both carousels the previous arrow is greyed out and the next arrow is active. Hover and focused versions are in the components frame.\n\n**Limitations**\n- The app mockup image has a light grey background, so I put it on a matching grey panel rather than letting the phones float on the orange.\n- Photos are used under their names in 04 · Media. The \"Toffee's Cake\" photo looks like a pancake stack, and the \"Pancake\" photo looks like a cake.\n- The reference pages (00, 01, 02 and 04) were not changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":69,"cache_creation_input_tokens":83500,"cache_read_input_tokens":7706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":83500,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d84beb6-d490-4e82-87ae-33d251e21179","uuid":"c0b1d03f-d28c-4731-8d0a-6fd6fb06f17c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:36:39.582Z"}
